# WITHERLEA: the Saucer (escape the manor) is the car: the keys from the
# dog's grave, and the garage door open. With the door down the engine only
# roars and brings him. After the ending and the credits it's back to the
# title, and CONTINUE puts you back where you were.
game witherlea
wait 5
cheat new
cheat spawn 99999
cheat give carkeys
cheat room garage
cheat hold carkeys
cheat aim S_GAR_CAR
press A
expect scene == 3
expect enc == 1
expect noises == 1
cheat hush
cheat new
cheat spawn 99999
cheat give carkeys
cheat set F_GARAGE_OPEN
cheat room garage
cheat hold carkeys
cheat aim S_GAR_CAR
press A
expect scene == 7
expect ending == 1
expect goals & 2
expect golds == 1
expect flag_F_GOLD_DONE == 1
expect ending_caught == 0
wait 31
press A
wait 31
press A
wait 31
press A
expect scene == 8
wait 91
press A
expect scene == 1
expect title_sel == 0
wait 20
press A
expect scene == 3
expect room == 12
expect has_carkeys == 1
